	(text "Note regarding component names:\n\nAll component designations written in red were either\nmissing, illegible, or duplicated. I attempted to deduce\ntheir meaning logically and have noted below which\ndesignations this applies to.\n\n- C1 assigned because it is unreadable\n- C4 assigned because it is unreadable\n- C9 assigned because there is no label\n- C42 assigned because it is unreadable\n- C101 assigned because it is unreadable\n- C106 assigned because it is unreadable\n\n- D21 assigned because it is duplicated (D20)\n\n- FL1, FL2, FL3 assigned because they are unreadable\n\n- Jx assigned because there is no label\n\n- L101 assigned because it is unreadable\n- LS1 assigned because there is no label\n\n- Q101 assigned because it is unreadable\n\n- RV1, RV2 assigned because there are no labels\n\n- U1, U2, U3 assigned because they are unreadable\n\n- XTAL1 assigned because it is unreadable"
